== Walkthrough ==

Menkes Tabolet is located at -229, -298 in South Qeynos (behind Fish's Ale).

You say, 'Hail, Menkes Tabolet'

: Menkes Tabolet says 'Greetings, fine citizen of Qeynos, what can I make for you today?  How about a genuine, handmade [rat fur cap]?  Or maybe a lovely [rat pelt cape]?  Maybe you'd like a necklace?  For a small fee, I can make a nice [snake fang necklace] or a [lucky rat's foot necklace].'

You say, 'I want a rat pelt cape'

: Menkes Tabolet says 'The rat pelt cape..  that happens to be my specialty!  I must say, it would be the perfect choice to go with that outfit you have on.  All I need are three [[Giant Rat Pelt]]s, those big ol' rats out in the hills work great for these capes, and 4 gold.  I must say, at these prices, everyone in Qeynos will be wearing one in a matter of weeks.'

Hand him three Giant Rat Pelts and 4 gold pieces.

: Menkes Tabolet says 'This cape turned out great.  It'll sure help keep you warm on those cold and stormy nights out in the Karanas.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[QeynosCitizen]] got better.
</div>
You gain experience!!

Receive a Rat Pelt Cape.

